[h1]Flavorium Universalis - Balance v0.4.0: EU5 1.4[/h1]

[i]Compatible with EU5 1.4.* | Requires: Flavorium Universalis[/i]

[hr][/hr]

Updated for EU5 1.4. The version jumps to 0.4 to match the game version. Not compatible with 1.3.

[h2]Advances[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]The three Age of Reformation literacy advances[/b] (Western, Colonial and East Asian) no longer require Printing Press, because 1.4 does not allow an advance to require one from an earlier age. Their regional conditions are unchanged, and the colonial one still requires a colonial nation.
[/list]
